    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Earnest are delighted to present No. 4 Verbena Lawn to the sales market. This three-bedroom semi-detached home is ideally positioned in this sought-after location, situated next to the coast and within a short walk of Bayside DART station. The property offers excellent potential for homeowners to create a wonderful family home to suit their own taste and style. It has been extended over the years to include a dining area and downstairs bathroom to the rear, further enhancing the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming porch entrance leading through a composite door with frosted glass surround into the hallway. Immediately to the left is a bright reception room with double sliding doors opening into the rear living room, which features an inset stove burner set into the fireplace. The living space continues through to the extended rear dining area and kitchen. Patio doors provide direct access to the rear garden. The kitchen can be accessed from both the hallway and dining area, offering a practical and well-connected layout.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation briefly comprises three bedrooms, including two large double bedrooms and a smaller double or single bedroom, along with the family bathroom. New carpets have been fitted throughout all bedrooms, the stairs and the landing.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a generously sized front garden with off-street parking, a lawn and mature trees and shrubs. A concrete ramp with handrails provides convenient access to the front door. A side entrance leads to the rear garden, which is not overlooked and comprises areas of lawn and artificial grass, mature trees and shrubs, and a concrete-built shed.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally located, with Bayside Shopping Centre and Bayside DART Station less than a 10-minute walk away. Excellent local schools, including Bayside SNS, St Fintan’s High School and Burrow National School, are all within easy reach. Howth, Raheny and Sutton are just a few minutes away by DART, while St Anne’s Park and Bull Island are also nearby. Dublin city centre is approximately a 20-minute drive away, with a great selection of local restaurants, cafés and pubs close by.\r\n\r\nContact Ken Lundy of Earnest estate agents to arrange a viewing now !!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Semi detached residence\r\nSought after location\r\nSituated within a short stroll to Bayside DART station\r\nExtended at the rear\r\nSide entrance\r\nNew carpets on stairs , landing and bedrooms\r\nGFCH\r\nNot overlooked from the rear\r\nOff street parking"
      },
